# Run inside Linux (Docker): keep LF even on a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*Dockerfile* text eol=lf
# Binary inputs: never convert line endings (a PDF's byte offsets break)
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.icc binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.docx binary
